    {
      "id": "34e8898e-8d54-4e4d-96eb-272df95dfc8b",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Documention\r\n## Known Issue\r\nBBC news articles are behind a *paywall* in the US but the API access is free. Therefore, I am **abandoning** this project.\r\n\r\n## Links\r\n[News](https://bbc-news-api.vercel.app/documentation#news)\r\n[Latest](https://bbc-news-api.vercel.app/documentation#latest)\r\n\r\n## Available Feeds\r\n\r\n### News\r\n- Arts\r\n- Business\r\n- Culture\r\n- Earth\r\n- Health\r\n- Latest Sport Audio\r\n- More World News\r\n- Must watch\r\n- Only from the BBC\r\n- Recommended audio\r\n- Sport\r\n- Technology\r\n- Travel\r\n- US \u0026 Canada News\r\n- Video\r\n- World\u0027s Table\r\n\r\n### Latest\r\n- Arts\r\n- Business\r\n- Culture\r\n- Earth\r\n- Health\r\n- Latest Sport Audio\r\n- More World News\r\n- Must watch\r\n- Only from the BBC\r\n- Recommended audio\r\n- Sport\r\n- Technology\r\n- Travel\r\n- US \u0026 Canada News\r\n- Video\r\n- World\u0027s Table"
    },
    {
      "id": "b224deb5-3531-41fc-9713-ca15f797ce7d",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "# Function Naming Convention Ideas\r\n- Get-BBCTravelNews\r\n- Get-TravelNews\r\n- Get-BBCTravelLatest\r\n- Get-BBCTravelCurrent\r\n- Get-LatestTravelNews\r\n- Get-BBCRecommendedAudioNews\r\n- Get-BBCRecommendedAudioLatest"
    },
    {
      "id": "9a2a1024-b988-44d7-b613-9e2621e2b724",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "# Powershell examples\r\n\r\n# Technology News\r\nInvoke-RestMethod -Uri  \u0027https://bbc-news-api.vercel.app/news?lang=english\u0027 -OutVariable bbcnewsapi\r\n$bbcnewsapi.Technology | select -First 1 | select title, news_link | Format-List",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cstyle\u003E.verso-ps-result{--ps-bg:var(--vscode-editor-background,var(--verso-cell-output-background,#fff));--ps-fg:var(--vscode-editor-foreground,var(--verso-cell-output-foreground,#1e1e1e));font-family:var(--verso-code-output-font-family,monospace);font-size:13px;color:var(--ps-fg);}.verso-ps-pre{margin:0;white-space:pre;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:1.4;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-ps-result\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre class=\u0022verso-ps-pre\u0022\u003Etitle     : Charlie Kirk\u0026#39;s family alleges \u0026#39;stunning failures\u0026#39; by Utah officials led to his assassination\r\nnews_link : https://bbc.com/news/articles/cwzrz4xmknjgo\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E"
        },
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "The term \u0027bbcnewsapi\u0027 is not recognized as a name of a cmdlet, function, script file, or executable program.\r\nCheck the spelling of the name, or if a path was included, verify that the path is correct and try again.",
