    {
      "id": "8126a319-205a-4d6e-883c-61145d41230c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "powershell",
      "source": "# Powershell example\r\n\r\n# Technology Latest\r\nInvoke-RestMethod -Uri  \u0027https://bbc-news-api.vercel.app/latest?lang=english \u0027 -OutVariable bbclatestapi\r\n$bbclatestapi.Technology| select -First 1 | select title, news_link | Format-List",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cstyle\u003E.verso-ps-result{--ps-bg:var(--vscode-editor-background,var(--verso-cell-output-background,#fff));--ps-fg:var(--vscode-editor-foreground,var(--verso-cell-output-foreground,#1e1e1e));font-family:var(--verso-code-output-font-family,monospace);font-size:13px;color:var(--ps-fg);}.verso-ps-pre{margin:0;white-space:pre;font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:1.4;}\u003C/style\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022verso-ps-result\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre class=\u0022verso-ps-pre\u0022\u003Estatus             : 200\r\nOnly from the BBC  : {@{title=Penitent sinner or fiery saint? 10 paintings of Mary Magdalene; summary=Known as the \u0026quot;apostle to the apostles\u201D, the controversial and multifaceted saint Mary Magdalene\r\n                     is shrouded in mythology and mystery. What do these artworks reveal about her?; image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160x90/p0p9rchf.jpg.webp;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/culture/article/20260915-why-mary-magdalene-is-a-divisive-biblical-figure}, @{title=To save scarlet macaws, scientists are rescuing chicks from their\r\n                     lethal parents; summary=Scarlet macaws are an iconic but declining tropical bird. To change the species\u0026#39; fate, scientists are working to counter a lethal parenting method that\r\n                     dooms many chicks to death.; image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160x90/p0p9pgl1.jpg.webp;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/future/article/20260915-to-save-scarlet-macaws-scientists-are-rescuing-chicks-from-their-lethal-parents}}\r\nRecommended audio  : {@{title=; summary=; image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160x90/p0p9pshl.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/audio/play/w3ct8mj2}, @{title=; summary=;\r\n                     image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160x90/p0p9pshl.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/audio/play/w3ct8mj2}, @{title=; summary=;\r\n                     image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160x90/p0p9t2ys.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/audio/play/p0p9t2y6}, @{title=; summary=;\r\n                     image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160x90/p0p9t2ys.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/audio/play/p0p9t2y6}\u2026}\r\nMust watch         : {@{title=How rising bond yields impact American consumers; summary=The BBC\u2019s Samira Hussain explains why some could see increased interest rates for mortgages and business\r\n                     loans.; image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/2548/live/ce0fe040-b16b-11f1-b1d1-571ed4d7ff2c.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/news/videos/cwz0zpyzrlr1o},\r\n                     @{title=Watch: Will Ed Sheeran cancel his tour as support acts quit?; summary=Sheeran\u0026#39;s backing band and all of his support acts pulled out of his US tour, so what happens now?;\r\n                     image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/596e/live/b7bd9d10-b1b5-11f1-bdcf-d393eb724fa3.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/news/videos/ck7v40jjv367o},\r\n                     @{title=\u0026#39;Maybe they\u0026#39;ll shoot you\u0026#39;: Carney recalls Trump\u0026#39;s gift of White House key; summary=The Canadian prime minister said the exchange \u201Csums up\u201D the Canada-US relationship.;\r\n                     image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/b09a/live/91c009a0-b114-11f1-b1d1-571ed4d7ff2c.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/news/videos/cwkgvkr1rz66o}, @{title=How\r\n                     are police dealing with shoplifting?; summary=Police say they are trialing new tactics to help deal with shoplifting in a Wiltshire town.;\r\n                     image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/8a24/live/273a37c0-b1c0-11f1-b1d1-571ed4d7ff2c.jpg.webp; news_link=https://bbc.com/news/videos/cmdx54k2pgk6o}\u2026}\r\nUS \u0026amp; Canada News   : {@{title=Republican senator presses Kash Patel on bestiality in bizarre exchange; summary=Patel defended the FBI\u0026#39;s updated hiring policy allowing applicants with a history of\r\n                     bestiality to qualify for a role in the law enforcement agency.; image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/d847/live/9ea36080-b160-11f1-b1d1-571ed4d7ff2c.jpg.webp;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/news/videos/cmrer2vjgqw8o}, @{title=Five takeaways from Canada\u0026#39;s push to woo the world\u0026#39;s richest investors; summary=; image_link=;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/news/articles/cmq8jdgel128o}, @{title=Pennsylvania officials report fourth measles-associated death in \u0026#39;surge\u0026#39; of cases; summary=; image_link=;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/news/articles/c8zxz31pdn46o}, @{title=Why is Donald Trump so opposed to regulating AI?; summary=; image_link=;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/news/videos/cmvgyp7n98zvo}\u2026}\r\nMore World News    : {@{title=Republican senator presses Kash Patel on bestiality in bizarre exchange; summary=Patel defended the FBI\u0026#39;s updated hiring policy allowing applicants with a history of\r\n                     bestiality to qualify for a role in the law enforcement agency.; image_link=https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/d847/live/9ea36080-b160-11f1-b1d1-571ed4d7ff2c.jpg.webp;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/news/videos/cmrer2vjgqw8o}, @{title=Five takeaways from Canada\u0026#39;s push to woo the world\u0026#39;s richest investors; summary=; image_link=;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/news/articles/cmq8jdgel128o}, @{title=Pennsylvania officials report fourth measles-associated death in \u0026#39;surge\u0026#39; of cases; summary=; image_link=;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.com/news/articles/c8zxz31pdn46o}, @{title=Why is Donald Trump so opposed to regulating AI?; summary=; image_link=;\r\n                     news_link=https://bbc.